quo;s 5 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids ran 68% of normal, and in 2026 so far January to February ran 37%. Grid 22380 had its driest year in 1953 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
